/**
 * Every JSON-RPC method the docs publish, per chain.
 *
 * Derived from the docs sitemap, one page per method per chain, cross-checked
 * against the method counts on the chain grid: all 83 chains agree exactly.
 * Names come from the reference's own titles where the docs index carries them,
 * and are reconstructed from the page slug otherwise (`eth-get-nft-balances` →
 * `eth_getNFTBalances`), which was spot-checked against the live pages.
 *
 * Method sets are hoisted into shared constants because chains overwhelmingly
 * share them: 469 chain-namespace pairs collapse to 174 distinct lists.
 */

